# {{project_name}}

<!-- openscaffold:fill One sentence on what this app does. -->

A [React Router](https://reactrouter.com) app with a streaming chat backed by [OpenRouter](https://openrouter.ai). Server code is [Effect](https://effect.website) services behind the app's own routes; LLM calls go through the [Vercel AI SDK](https://ai-sdk.dev).

## Quickstart

Requires [bun](https://bun.sh) and Node.

```bash
cp .env.example .env   # set OPENROUTER_API_KEY to enable chat
bun install            # also installs the git hooks and Chromium for the e2e test
bun run dev            # http://localhost:5173
```

Without a key everything still builds, tests, and renders; the chat reports that it isn't configured.

## Configuration

All settings come from `.env` (copy `.env.example`), which the dev server and `bun run start` load. Restart the server after editing it.

